{"name":"9-3-1E","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG9-Dinner","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"......"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I believe we've gotten through most of the details. That bastard Havier's probably told you some unsavory things."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, I trust that you won't be shaken by a few malicious words."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kryuger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Indeed, I have paid no mind to it. I've already instructed my subordinates to immediately begin preparations for this operation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good. You may have noticed as well, that there may be people planning to interfere in this operation, so the sooner we begin, the better."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kryuger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We can begin today. Our Commander will head over to the frontline together with your troops. His T-Doll echelons are already on standby there."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Very well, Yegor can give your Commander a ride on his helicopter."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kryuger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood. Before we leave, however, I'd like to have a few words with him alone."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No problem. I also need to give some orders as well."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG9-Dinner","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Carter steps away with his subordinate."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Kryuger listens to the latest report."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Kryuger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see... So the remaining members of the AR Team have gone missing as well. Commander, you must do whatever it takes to find them."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Though Havier may seem like an unreliable fellow, he's not one to talk nonsense."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I suspect that something big will happen during this operation, so I will place all available Griffin T-Dolls under your command."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Trust in your own judgment, and stay safe."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"克鲁格","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Kryuger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've said all that needs to be said. Let's go, Yegor is waiting for us outside."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Kryuger opens the door."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you done? Captain, head out with Griffin's Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yegor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Yegor","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, sir."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kyruger","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kryuger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"General, I still have some questions for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Carter","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Carter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The door closes. Kryuger and Carter disappear into the crowded banquet."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yegor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Yegor","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This way, Commander of Griffin."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"......"}]}]}]}
